senses.gloss:
--the first kalpa; explained in the वायव्य पुराण;
1: M. २९०. 3; ५३. १८.
धर्मवृता performed tapas in and became turned to a stone;
2: वा. १०७. 6.
वाराह in;
3: Ib. १०५. 7; १०६. ३२; १०९. ३५.
शिव takes the अवतार् of Sad- योजात, all white, when गायत्री also is born with him.
4: Ib. २३. ६३.
